  "description": "Picture-perfect high school sweethearts Na-eun Gwon and Seon-ho Ji split up on graduation day—leaving Na-eun puzzled and heartbroken. Five years later, Seon-ho is an A-list superstar, while Na-eun is a struggling actress desperate for her big break. When Na-eun lands a lead role in a high-profile romantic comedy alongside her ex, she proposes a high-stakes bet: whoever falls in love first buys the other a house! As real-life feelings blur with their on-screen romance, can Na-eun keep her cool on set?\n\n(Source: Webtoon Entertainment)",
